From 97ad04da36ddf9825847554537fc97fefdde3794 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 20:14:56 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] feat(ui): design system v2 - new brand palette,
 light/dark preset, navy sidebar, BrandMark

- PrimeVue preset: brand ramp around #01bec2, deep-blue #003a54 secondary,
  cool neutral surfaces, a real dark scheme, visible focus ring, calmer
  component shapes (buttons, cards, tags, datatable header).
- Contrast-safe action color: white on #01bec2 is 2.30:1 (fails AA), so the
  light-theme action shade is #00797f (white 5.20:1); dark theme keeps bright
  teal with deep-blue text (5.28:1).
- tokens.scss: brand/hero/sidebar tokens, navy-tinted shadows, larger radii.
- DashboardSidebar: deep-blue shell via tokens, translucent active state.
- New BrandMark SVG logo component.
